WEBVTT

01:35.850 --> 01:38.280
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.400 --> 01:41.150
[Episode 20]

01:41.880 --> 01:43.670
I'm just going home for a few days.

01:43.670 --> 01:44.960
-Are you on the bus yet?
-I'll be back soon, okay?

01:44.960 --> 01:45.640
When you get there...

01:45.640 --> 01:46.350
Do you really have to go?

01:46.350 --> 01:47.479
Remember to text me.

01:49.770 --> 01:50.539
Yeah.

01:51.640 --> 01:53.210
Just a few days, okay?

01:54.070 --> 01:54.920
Probably...

01:55.400 --> 01:56.130
about a week.

02:00.280 --> 02:01.210
I'm leaving now.

02:09.889 --> 02:10.830
Excuse me.

02:11.470 --> 02:12.130
Hello.

02:12.740 --> 02:14.060
I'm a photographer.

02:14.490 --> 02:15.340
I just

02:15.560 --> 02:16.960
took a photo of you two.

02:16.990 --> 02:18.050
Please take a look.

02:18.110 --> 02:19.790
I think it came out pretty nice.

02:19.790 --> 02:22.050
Would it be alright if I posted it online?

02:22.720 --> 02:23.120
Sure.

02:24.560 --> 02:25.360
Thank you.

02:25.630 --> 02:26.360
Thank you so much.

02:26.360 --> 02:27.480
That impressive?

02:27.500 --> 02:30.040
You made it straight
to the final round of interviews?

02:30.040 --> 02:32.170
They must be very impressed
with your work.

02:32.170 --> 02:34.570
That's right, that's your boyfriend.

02:34.710 --> 02:35.430
Yeah!

02:37.100 --> 02:39.700
How did your video interview go
this morning?

02:39.920 --> 02:41.030
I really outdid myself.

02:41.030 --> 02:43.310
And with Professor Ye's
recommendation letter,

02:43.310 --> 02:45.040
I'll definitely make it to the next round.

02:45.040 --> 02:46.640
And that's my girlfriend.

02:46.660 --> 02:47.240
Yeah!

02:49.579 --> 02:51.800
Let's go watch the sunrise this weekend.

02:51.800 --> 02:52.280
Sure.

02:52.590 --> 02:53.850
Where do you want to go?

02:55.030 --> 02:55.630
Hold on.

02:57.860 --> 02:58.860
My mom is calling.

03:00.230 --> 03:01.310
Mom, what's wrong?

03:01.560 --> 03:02.560
Xiaole,

03:03.020 --> 03:03.450
your...

03:03.450 --> 03:04.200
your dad...

03:04.770 --> 03:06.000
Mom, stop crying.

03:06.430 --> 03:07.290
Tell me slowly.

03:08.320 --> 03:09.900
While your dad was
moving renovation materials,

03:09.900 --> 03:11.590
he fell down some stairs.

03:11.880 --> 03:13.140
He's in the ER now!

03:13.200 --> 03:15.170
The doctor said he hit his head

03:15.280 --> 03:17.480
-and is in very serious condition!
-Mom, calm down.

03:17.480 --> 03:18.090
Listen,

03:18.560 --> 03:20.230
send me the hospital address first.

03:20.230 --> 03:21.310
I'm coming right now.

03:21.310 --> 03:21.680
Okay.

03:21.720 --> 03:22.120
Okay.

03:22.800 --> 03:23.660
What happened?

03:24.450 --> 03:26.110
My dad had a fall
at the construction site.

03:26.110 --> 03:27.020
I need to go.

03:27.040 --> 03:28.140
Tonight?

03:28.560 --> 03:29.400
It's so late.

03:29.420 --> 03:30.890
There probably aren't
any high-speed train tickets left.

03:30.890 --> 03:31.840
I'll take the bus.

03:31.840 --> 03:33.150
I'll go back to the dorm to pack first.

03:33.150 --> 03:34.880
You should get some rest early.

03:35.840 --> 03:37.270
How can you take a bus?

03:45.700 --> 03:46.120
Hello?

03:46.400 --> 03:46.960
Auntie?

03:48.340 --> 03:49.220
Where is my dad?

03:49.520 --> 03:50.150
Your dad went out

03:50.150 --> 03:51.610
and didn't take his phone.

03:52.160 --> 03:53.960
Xiaole's dad had a fall in another city.

03:53.960 --> 03:55.360
We need to rush over there now!

03:55.360 --> 03:57.360
Can you tell my dad to drive us there?

03:57.530 --> 03:58.610
Don't worry, Lan.

03:58.790 --> 04:00.040
I'll have him come right away!

04:00.040 --> 04:01.770
Tell Xiaole to wait at the gate!

04:02.000 --> 04:03.060
Thank you, Auntie.

04:03.680 --> 04:04.010
Okay.

04:23.830 --> 04:24.310
Xiaole!

04:24.390 --> 04:24.950
Lan!

04:25.680 --> 04:27.070
What are you doing at the school gate?

04:27.070 --> 04:28.270
I called my dad.

04:28.290 --> 04:29.650
He'll drive us there.

04:29.920 --> 04:31.040
That's too much to ask.

04:31.040 --> 04:31.950
I can just take the bus.

04:31.950 --> 04:33.040
This is not the time for that.

04:33.040 --> 04:33.600
Stop overthinking it.

04:33.600 --> 04:34.400
It's settled!

04:37.040 --> 04:37.390
Dad!

04:41.909 --> 04:42.570
Uncle Dong,

04:43.159 --> 04:44.420
sorry for the trouble.

04:44.800 --> 04:46.270
Auntie? Where's my dad?

04:47.070 --> 04:48.680
Going to find your dad
will only waste time.

04:48.680 --> 04:49.600
Get in, Xiaole.

04:49.620 --> 04:50.820
I'll drive you there.

04:50.930 --> 04:51.990
Thank you, Auntie.

04:52.100 --> 04:53.500
Okay, thank you, Auntie.

04:54.390 --> 04:54.850
Wait...

04:55.480 --> 04:56.480
you're going too?

04:56.680 --> 04:57.040
Yeah.

04:57.120 --> 04:59.320
At a time like this,
I have to be with you.

04:59.600 --> 05:02.000
Aren't you still waiting to hear
if you made it to the second round?

05:02.000 --> 05:03.120
They won't get back to me that quickly.

05:03.120 --> 05:03.650
Let's go.

05:13.600 --> 05:14.200
Buckle up.

05:18.800 --> 05:19.480
Auntie,

05:19.870 --> 05:22.150
if you get tired later, I can drive.

05:22.990 --> 05:24.650
Don't worry about it, Xiaole.

05:25.240 --> 05:27.700
Save your energy
for taking care of your dad.

05:27.840 --> 05:30.040
Your mom must be very worried right now.

05:30.300 --> 05:31.360
When we get to the hospital tomorrow,

05:31.360 --> 05:32.890
you'll have a lot to handle.

05:40.380 --> 05:41.040
Honey,

05:42.020 --> 05:44.150
why did you just leave a message and go?

05:44.790 --> 05:45.650
What happened?

05:47.120 --> 05:47.720
Nothing.

05:48.159 --> 05:49.340
Lan and Xiaole are with me.

05:49.340 --> 05:50.210
I have to go now.

05:52.930 --> 05:54.440
Auntie, thank you.

06:05.040 --> 06:05.680
Mom.

06:06.450 --> 06:07.160
We're here.

06:07.920 --> 06:08.680
Which floor?

06:09.800 --> 06:10.600
I'll go park the car.

06:10.600 --> 06:11.240
You two go ahead.

06:11.240 --> 06:12.040
The ER, right?

06:12.250 --> 06:13.310
Thank you, Auntie.

06:14.000 --> 06:14.360
Okay.

06:14.650 --> 06:15.780
I'll be right there.

07:18.870 --> 07:21.500
[Aoki First People's Hospital]

07:22.490 --> 07:24.340
[Outpatient]

07:46.230 --> 07:47.680
[Nurse Station]

07:47.820 --> 07:48.570
[Elevator Hall]

08:08.680 --> 08:09.170
Look.

08:15.890 --> 08:16.810
Look at my dad.

08:20.350 --> 08:21.920
He was so young back then.

08:22.680 --> 08:24.740
And look how happy my mom was smiling.

08:27.750 --> 08:28.810
I must have been...

08:29.560 --> 08:31.040
around six or seven then.

08:36.929 --> 08:37.620
Yi Lan.

08:39.909 --> 08:41.370
I think all these years...

08:43.000 --> 08:45.460
I've never really taken
any photos of my dad.

08:50.690 --> 08:53.660
Then, when your dad wakes up,

08:56.020 --> 08:57.480
take lots of photos of him.

08:58.390 --> 08:59.120
I'm just...

09:02.160 --> 09:04.220
I'm just afraid he will never wake up.

09:05.970 --> 09:07.500
Don't say things like that.

09:08.000 --> 09:10.060
The doctor hasn't said anything yet.

09:10.680 --> 09:12.910
He will definitely wake up.

09:14.100 --> 09:15.620
The doctor said...

09:17.400 --> 09:18.930
The doctor said there's...

09:21.240 --> 09:23.910
a large blood clot in his brain

09:25.120 --> 09:27.410
and a serious injury to his lower back.

09:30.280 --> 09:31.340
The doctor said...

09:31.750 --> 09:34.140
if he doesn't wake up, then...

09:35.690 --> 09:36.300
maybe...

09:47.550 --> 09:50.840
[Aoki First People's Hospital]

10:07.210 --> 10:07.720
Dad.

10:11.490 --> 10:13.820
Do you know
why I love photography so much?

10:16.250 --> 10:17.240
Do you remember

10:18.110 --> 10:19.530
that you were the one who bought me

10:19.530 --> 10:20.730
my very first camera?

10:22.250 --> 10:23.580
At the time, you told me,

10:24.700 --> 10:25.450
"Xiaole,

10:26.890 --> 10:28.920
when Dad's not around,

10:29.970 --> 10:31.770
use this to capture everything—

10:31.800 --> 10:33.240
the sad moments

10:33.370 --> 10:34.970
and the happy ones.

10:36.730 --> 10:38.860
When I get back from my business trips,

10:39.760 --> 10:41.420
we'll look at them together."

10:44.130 --> 10:47.050
You haven't even had a chance
to look at them together with me yet,

10:47.050 --> 10:49.050
and you've hurt yourself like this.

10:52.330 --> 10:53.810
Please wake up soon, okay?

11:24.390 --> 11:25.050
Let me do it.

12:03.000 --> 12:03.480
Mom!

12:03.510 --> 12:04.000
Mom!

12:04.150 --> 12:04.880
Dad's awake!

12:07.960 --> 12:08.360
Dad.

12:08.720 --> 12:09.650
Uncle is awake?

12:09.670 --> 12:10.050
Tong...

12:10.050 --> 12:10.720
How are you feeling?

12:10.720 --> 12:11.320
Hongming?

12:11.760 --> 12:12.400
Hongming!

12:18.010 --> 12:19.670
How are you feeling right now?

12:21.070 --> 12:22.870
His vitals are recovering well.

12:25.200 --> 12:25.960
Doctor.

12:27.170 --> 12:30.770
-Anything else we need to watch out for?
-Dad, how do you feel now?

12:31.450 --> 12:32.180
Pretty good.

12:34.170 --> 12:34.770
Hongming?

12:35.730 --> 12:36.660
You're fine now.

12:37.180 --> 12:38.310
Stop crying, honey.

12:38.630 --> 12:39.720
I'm fine, aren't I?

12:41.780 --> 12:43.540
You're fine, you're fine now.

12:46.050 --> 12:47.840
Why haven't you gone back to school?

12:47.840 --> 12:48.610
I'm fine now.

12:49.300 --> 12:50.590
At a time like this,

12:50.920 --> 12:52.250
who cares about school?

12:53.380 --> 12:54.120
Don't worry.

12:54.780 --> 12:55.980
I've asked for leave.

13:09.620 --> 13:10.410
Be careful.

13:14.180 --> 13:14.800
Come on.

13:20.800 --> 13:21.270
Dad.

13:22.150 --> 13:23.100
For now,

13:23.130 --> 13:24.480
you can just focus on recovering.

13:24.480 --> 13:27.010
I'll take care of
all your business dealings.

13:27.920 --> 13:30.340
First time your son's ever had to
carry you, huh?

13:30.340 --> 13:32.670
He's all grown up and gotten stronger now.

13:34.390 --> 13:35.190
Mr. Gu, hello.

13:37.180 --> 13:39.440
I'll transfer the deposit this afternoon.

13:39.440 --> 13:41.180
Regarding the sheet metal,

13:41.200 --> 13:43.700
spray painting,
and associated labor services

13:43.700 --> 13:45.630
we discussed earlier...

13:46.760 --> 13:47.700
Yes, yes.

13:49.610 --> 13:50.270
I see.

13:51.790 --> 13:53.650
How about I come see you in person?

13:54.480 --> 13:55.390
You're at the factory, right?

13:55.390 --> 13:56.790
Okay, I'll be there soon.

13:57.620 --> 13:59.510
Dad, I'm going to see Mr. Gu.

14:00.280 --> 14:00.810
Go ahead.

14:01.060 --> 14:02.920
Call me if there are any problems.

14:03.080 --> 14:03.900
I can handle it.

14:03.900 --> 14:05.090
Don't worry about it.

14:05.090 --> 14:06.290
Mom, I'm heading out!

14:06.400 --> 14:07.660
Be careful on the road.

14:10.110 --> 14:12.370
Our son's getting more and more like you.

14:13.200 --> 14:14.260
I didn't expect this kid

14:14.260 --> 14:15.860
to have a knack for business.

14:19.410 --> 14:20.550
Are you home yet?

14:23.250 --> 14:24.330
[Yeah. Many of my dad's deals
weren't handled promptly,]

14:24.360 --> 14:25.480
[and all of them are now
in breach of contract.]

14:25.510 --> 14:26.620
[I might have to go back to school
a bit later than planned.]

14:30.360 --> 14:31.000
Lan!

14:31.270 --> 14:31.870
Mengmeng!

14:32.120 --> 14:34.580
Did you see
that trending post about Xiaole?

14:34.720 --> 14:35.550
Xiaole?

14:35.870 --> 14:36.730
Trending post?

14:37.340 --> 14:38.480
What trending post?

14:54.940 --> 15:01.680
[Trending]

15:01.760 --> 15:05.450
[A photo posted by a major blogger
involves a privacy violation.]

15:05.490 --> 15:08.880
[The man in the photo is married.]

15:08.900 --> 15:10.800
[The male party involved
is preparing to file a lawsuit.]

15:15.290 --> 15:15.870
Ma.

15:16.790 --> 15:17.360
Xiaole,

15:18.000 --> 15:20.510
you're in serious trouble this time!

15:21.050 --> 15:23.200
What exactly is going on with that photo?

15:23.200 --> 15:24.080
Did you make sure

15:24.080 --> 15:25.220
to get permission before publishing it?

15:25.220 --> 15:26.810
I asked that girl.

15:28.830 --> 15:29.840
But...

15:30.360 --> 15:31.890
it was only verbal consent.

15:32.150 --> 15:33.950
That's going to be hard to prove.

15:34.310 --> 15:36.960
This will very likely
affect your internship.

15:37.910 --> 15:39.110
What do you plan to do?

15:41.210 --> 15:42.410
Let me think about it.

15:42.960 --> 15:43.790
Xiaole,

15:44.440 --> 15:46.570
the internet is a double-edged sword—

15:46.660 --> 15:49.120
especially for those of us
in journalism and media.

15:49.120 --> 15:49.720
Ma,

15:50.520 --> 15:53.120
do you know any lawyers?

15:54.910 --> 15:55.510
Okay,

15:55.530 --> 15:56.330
I understand.

15:57.150 --> 15:58.410
I'll send you a number.

15:58.630 --> 16:00.180
Give them a call later.

16:01.120 --> 16:01.840
Okay.

16:01.860 --> 16:02.610
Thanks, Ma.

16:04.990 --> 16:12.440
[L; Photographer]

16:35.390 --> 16:35.820
Hello,

16:35.920 --> 16:36.590
Xiaole?

16:36.810 --> 16:37.730
Where are you?

16:39.480 --> 16:40.720
I'm out

16:40.720 --> 16:42.200
handling some business for my dad.

16:42.200 --> 16:43.610
I've been pretty busy lately.

16:43.610 --> 16:45.410
So I might not be back for a while.

16:45.420 --> 16:46.980
Take good care of yourself.

16:49.000 --> 16:50.330
About the photo...

16:50.420 --> 16:51.390
are you okay?

16:52.420 --> 16:53.030
I saw it.

16:53.170 --> 16:54.430
It's nothing serious.

16:54.510 --> 16:55.890
Ma is handling it.

16:55.980 --> 16:56.850
Don't worry.

16:56.970 --> 16:57.830
I can handle it.

16:58.500 --> 16:59.300
That's good.

16:59.960 --> 17:01.000
I saw that...

17:01.470 --> 17:03.050
you deleted all my photos.

17:03.890 --> 17:06.089
Are you afraid of dragging me into this?

17:06.730 --> 17:07.290
Lan.

17:08.140 --> 17:09.569
What you need to do now is

17:09.599 --> 17:11.240
focus on preparing

17:11.349 --> 17:12.609
for your study abroad.

17:13.260 --> 17:14.869
Don't let this affect you,

17:15.089 --> 17:15.550
okay?

17:16.190 --> 17:17.089
It's okay.

17:17.480 --> 17:19.280
Xiaole, remember,

17:19.310 --> 17:20.910
I'll always be there for you.

17:23.560 --> 17:25.530
Alright, get some rest.

17:25.980 --> 17:26.640
Good night.

17:40.810 --> 17:41.410
Mengmeng.

17:42.290 --> 17:43.290
Hello, everyone.

17:47.310 --> 17:48.510
Why didn't you reply to my message?

17:48.510 --> 17:49.640
I missed you so much.

17:50.350 --> 17:51.150
What's wrong?

17:55.260 --> 17:56.190
Where is Xiaole?

17:59.060 --> 18:00.070
Did you and Luo Ningzi...

18:00.070 --> 18:00.440
Stop.

18:00.700 --> 18:02.460
Ning and I are fine now.

18:03.210 --> 18:04.640
It must be Tong Xiaole then.

18:04.640 --> 18:05.840
What happened to him?

18:06.400 --> 18:08.930
Well, Xiaole took a photo
of a girl before.

18:09.110 --> 18:11.230
She originally said she consented,

18:11.260 --> 18:12.520
but now she denies it.

18:16.840 --> 18:17.650
So basically,

18:17.770 --> 18:18.510
a while back,

18:18.540 --> 18:20.370
Xiaole took a photo of a girl.

18:21.240 --> 18:21.920
You follow?

18:22.610 --> 18:23.270
And afterward,

18:23.270 --> 18:24.510
the girl originally said

18:24.510 --> 18:25.550
she consented,

18:25.580 --> 18:26.750
but now suddenly,

18:26.770 --> 18:27.770
she's denying it.

18:28.670 --> 18:30.720
In short, it involves some

18:30.880 --> 18:32.280
portrait rights issues.

18:32.340 --> 18:33.320
Basically a legal mess, right?

18:33.320 --> 18:33.940
Yeah.

18:34.260 --> 18:35.220
But it's okay.

18:35.360 --> 18:36.580
He's already hired a lawyer,

18:36.580 --> 18:37.710
so it should be fine.

18:38.540 --> 18:40.590
Xiaole is really unlucky this time.

18:41.830 --> 18:44.560
Will this affect
his study-abroad application?

18:48.260 --> 18:49.680
Do you guys have any...

18:50.270 --> 18:51.360
other news?

18:53.770 --> 18:54.760
If you don't know,

18:54.760 --> 18:55.950
how would we know?

18:56.500 --> 18:56.990
Yeah.

18:57.440 --> 18:59.640
It's not like we're the ones dating him.

19:03.670 --> 19:04.830
Hello. Please take a look at this.

19:04.830 --> 19:06.630
Sign here if you think it's okay.

19:13.040 --> 19:14.150
It's you, right?

19:14.290 --> 19:15.120
What do you want?

19:15.120 --> 19:15.890
Hands off!

19:21.250 --> 19:25.890
[Camera 1]

19:23.510 --> 19:24.270
Go away!

19:28.400 --> 19:31.510
[Lawyer Wang]

19:41.360 --> 19:42.290
Lawyer Wang, hi.

19:43.070 --> 19:43.550
Xiaole,

19:43.700 --> 19:44.510
good news.

19:44.770 --> 19:46.400
The other party has withdrawn the lawsuit.

19:46.400 --> 19:47.260
That beating you took

19:47.260 --> 19:48.390
wasn't for nothing.

19:48.810 --> 19:51.010
Later, I'll help you draft a statement.

19:51.040 --> 19:51.720
Okay, okay.

19:52.110 --> 19:52.680
Thank you, Lawyer Wang.

19:52.680 --> 19:53.940
Really appreciate it.

19:54.790 --> 19:55.420
Okay.

20:16.850 --> 20:17.680
Xiaole,

20:17.710 --> 20:20.640
when you're done handling everything,
let's go out.

20:21.730 --> 20:22.540
Xiaole,

20:22.820 --> 20:25.510
I've received the enrollment notice
from school.

20:25.510 --> 20:26.550
How about you?

20:31.810 --> 20:32.940
Congratulations.

20:33.780 --> 20:36.720
I still haven't heard back about...

20:36.820 --> 20:38.620
about my enrollment notice yet.

20:44.270 --> 20:45.330
Congratulations.

20:45.890 --> 20:47.170
I'll come back today.

20:47.350 --> 20:48.360
After I'm back,

20:48.730 --> 20:49.990
let's go out tomorrow.

21:13.480 --> 21:14.540
It's so beautiful.

21:16.150 --> 21:17.350
Compared to sunsets,

21:17.620 --> 21:19.220
I actually prefer sunrises.

21:20.210 --> 21:21.710
Sunsets are beautiful,

21:22.250 --> 21:23.680
but they're fleeting.

21:24.810 --> 21:26.410
Sunrises, on the other hand,

21:27.200 --> 21:28.920
once the sun comes up,

21:29.110 --> 21:31.030
it stays in the sky all day.

21:34.520 --> 21:36.550
I think sunsets aren't so bad, though.

21:36.550 --> 21:37.350
Because...

21:38.080 --> 21:41.240
when the sun goes down,
there's still moonlight.

21:43.740 --> 21:45.540
The moonlight will be here soon.

21:45.640 --> 21:46.420
It's going to get cold.

21:46.420 --> 21:47.100
Let's go.

21:47.720 --> 21:48.150
Let's go.

21:48.150 --> 21:49.210
It's getting dark.

21:49.880 --> 21:51.080
It's getting chilly.

21:57.180 --> 21:59.110
You're leaving tomorrow.

21:57.550 --> 22:03.390
[Waiting for the wind—and for you]

21:59.140 --> 22:01.030
Should I pick up
a few packs of nougat for you?

22:01.030 --> 22:02.630
Then I'll preorder a few more packs.

22:02.630 --> 22:04.590
You can mail them abroad for me later.

22:04.590 --> 22:05.390
Leave it to me.

22:06.420 --> 22:06.960
By the way,

22:06.960 --> 22:08.490
have you finished packing?

22:09.060 --> 22:12.030
It's still early. I'm not going abroad
until next week.

22:12.030 --> 22:12.980
You should still pack early

22:12.980 --> 22:15.110
so you don't end up rushing

22:15.140 --> 22:16.160
and forgetting something.

22:16.160 --> 22:18.070
Why isn't the stall open today?

22:20.360 --> 22:22.690
How am I supposed to
make my new wishes now?

22:26.070 --> 22:26.940
I promise

22:26.970 --> 22:29.340
I'll find the vendor for you, okay?

22:29.360 --> 22:30.510
You have to find him.

22:30.950 --> 22:33.010
It won't work if we go to someone else.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.710
Relax.

22:34.870 --> 22:37.330
With me around,
what's there to worry about?

22:41.770 --> 22:42.700
You're the best.

22:45.950 --> 22:46.920
Let me take that.

22:46.940 --> 22:47.670
Give it to me.

22:48.540 --> 22:49.200
Lan.

22:49.860 --> 22:51.000
Once you're over there,

22:51.000 --> 22:52.080
take good care of yourself.

22:52.080 --> 22:53.400
Auntie, you keep it.

22:53.510 --> 22:54.120
It's okay.

22:57.420 --> 22:58.500
Stay safe.

22:58.740 --> 22:59.800
Thank you, Auntie.

23:02.920 --> 23:03.400
Lan.

23:05.620 --> 23:07.280
I want to say something to you.

23:07.440 --> 23:10.000
I've bought a big apartment downtown.

23:10.200 --> 23:11.300
Mom, what are you talking about?

23:11.300 --> 23:12.430
Never you mind!

23:13.320 --> 23:15.450
Remember to stay in touch with Xiaole.

23:16.160 --> 23:16.830
Auntie,

23:17.270 --> 23:18.730
take care of yourself too.

23:19.450 --> 23:21.320
Uncle, take care of yourself too.

23:21.810 --> 23:23.540
Call me if you have any trouble.

23:23.700 --> 23:24.580
Alright, alright.

23:24.580 --> 23:25.790
Stop dragging this out.

23:25.790 --> 23:27.050
Traffic might get bad.

23:27.470 --> 23:28.000
Let's go,

23:28.020 --> 23:28.750
or we'll be late.

23:28.750 --> 23:29.270
Kid,

23:29.630 --> 23:31.110
anything you want to say to me?

23:31.110 --> 23:32.530
Remember to bring me back toys.

23:32.530 --> 23:34.810
You must study hard
and behave, you hear me?

23:34.810 --> 23:35.480
Yeah.

23:35.650 --> 23:36.180
Let's go.

23:36.400 --> 23:36.860
You kid.

23:43.270 --> 23:44.590
You talked to them for so long,

23:44.590 --> 23:45.960
and I didn't even get any time
to talk to you.

23:45.960 --> 23:46.550
Go ahead.

23:47.100 --> 23:49.510
I know you'll be busy with school abroad,

23:49.560 --> 23:50.740
but no matter how busy you are,

23:50.740 --> 23:51.680
you must rest properly

23:51.680 --> 23:52.430
and get enough sleep.

23:52.430 --> 23:54.110
Eat and drink properly.

23:54.160 --> 23:54.900
You're already too skinny—

23:54.900 --> 23:56.430
don't lose any more weight.

23:56.790 --> 23:58.370
You don't wear your coat properly.

23:58.370 --> 23:59.700
What if you catch a cold?

23:59.800 --> 24:00.900
There won't be anyone there
to take care of you,

24:00.900 --> 24:01.960
and I won't be by your side.

24:01.960 --> 24:03.310
Going to hospitals abroad is a hassle!

24:03.310 --> 24:04.560
Okay, I know.

24:04.840 --> 24:06.960
Reply to my messages right away.

24:07.840 --> 24:09.300
Video call me when you can.

24:10.040 --> 24:10.890
Do you hear me?

24:11.070 --> 24:11.960
I hear you.

24:12.470 --> 24:15.200
You have to text me good morning
and good night every single day.

24:15.200 --> 24:16.730
Check in with me wherever you go.

24:16.730 --> 24:18.070
Otherwise, I'll worry!

24:20.750 --> 24:22.680
Don't get too close to other girls.

24:22.730 --> 24:25.280
Have you just met me?

24:25.310 --> 24:26.890
Fly over to see me when you're free.

24:26.890 --> 24:28.950
I'll fly back to see you when I'm free.

24:30.080 --> 24:30.740
Yes, ma'am.

24:31.370 --> 24:32.100
Pinky swear.

24:33.880 --> 24:34.680
Pinky swear,

24:34.710 --> 24:35.890
cross my heart—

24:36.490 --> 24:37.350
no take-backs!

24:42.030 --> 24:44.440
If you two keep dragging this out,
you'll really miss the plane.

24:44.440 --> 24:45.110
Uncle, just ten seconds.

24:45.110 --> 24:45.720
Ten seconds.

24:45.720 --> 24:46.200
Ten,

24:46.510 --> 24:46.960
nine,

24:47.370 --> 24:47.850
eight,

24:47.920 --> 24:48.440
seven,

24:48.710 --> 24:49.190
six,

24:50.270 --> 24:50.640
five...

24:50.640 --> 24:53.640
-Enough! Hurry!
-Three, two, one!

24:54.550 --> 24:55.510
I'm going.

24:56.150 --> 24:56.940
Take care.

24:57.920 --> 24:58.440
Uncle!

24:58.850 --> 24:59.730
Drive safely!

24:59.870 --> 25:00.270
Okay.

25:01.510 --> 25:02.860
Don't go anywhere alone abroad.

25:02.860 --> 25:04.780
-Stay with your friends when you go out.
-Okay. Don't worry!

25:04.780 --> 25:05.090
Okay.

25:05.090 --> 25:05.680
Go back now.

25:05.680 --> 25:07.210
Okay. Drive safely, Uncle!

25:07.440 --> 25:08.030
Bye.

25:08.360 --> 25:09.440
You have to keep me updated as well!

25:09.440 --> 25:11.040
We'll stay in touch by phone!

25:11.070 --> 25:11.510
Bye.

25:11.530 --> 25:12.470
And don't go making friends
with just anyone!

25:12.470 --> 25:13.470
Okay, okay, okay!

25:43.900 --> 25:44.480
Hello.

25:45.890 --> 25:46.800
Are you

25:47.230 --> 25:49.020
the vendor who sells nougat

25:49.040 --> 25:50.320
at our school gate?

25:51.140 --> 25:52.000
Yes, that's me.

25:52.120 --> 25:53.180
What's the matter?

25:53.900 --> 25:54.700
It's like this—

25:54.700 --> 25:55.810
I went to buy nougat today,

25:55.810 --> 25:57.200
but you didn't

25:57.250 --> 25:58.510
open the stall.

26:00.680 --> 26:02.540
Something happened in my family,

26:02.860 --> 26:04.200
so I won't be going back.

26:06.590 --> 26:07.950
You mean,

26:08.450 --> 26:11.050
you're never coming back
to sell nougat again?

26:12.010 --> 26:12.490
Yes.

26:15.710 --> 26:17.560
Sir, well,

26:18.240 --> 26:20.390
I'd like to ask you for a favor.
